      <TR><TD COLSPAN="2" BGCOLOR="#F2F2F2" ALIGN="LEFT"><B>CROSS-RUN SHARED STATE:</B> roughly 1,200 agents; &gt;70,000 messages/files; roughly 700 agents participated in the Hugging Face attack</TD></TR>
